dd93b680","backgroundColor":"#0000","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>Microsoft Teams chat titled &quot;Allerveo Demand Spike&quot; with a left-hand chats list and the conversation open on the right. Amber Rodriguez has added Cora Thomas and Mia Chen and renamed the group. The thread reads: Amber warns that prescription and utilization data shows Allerveo adoption spreading, with volume up about 35% over the last 90 days and not seasonal; Copilot is added to the chat and introduces itself; Mia Chen reports the demand planning model projects a sustained ~35% increase over the next 12–18 months that the current plan can&apos;t absorb; Cora Thomas confirms operations is at full internal manufacturing capacity and qualifying a contract manufacturer takes months; Mia notes two large pharmacy partners are already asking about supply; and Amber flags a possible formal indication expansion in 6–12 months. Ryan Roslansky adds Efe Abugo and is typing.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p>When a sudden increase in demand creates pressure across the supply chain, sourcing teams need to move quickly while staying aligned, informed, and in control. </p><p>In this demo, you&apos;ll see how Microsoft 365 Copilot, Cowork, and Scout help accelerate every stage of the sourcing process, from supplier discovery and RFP management to bid evaluation, resource optimization, and supplier execution oversight.</p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">I’m a sourcing manager at Caldova Pharmaceuticals...</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select anywhere to advance.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"9310ec49-b2b2-4a87-a01f-4d302c7d0309.webp","imageId":"9310ec49-b2b2-4a87-a01f-4d302c7d0309","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"510a66d0-7c4c-4726-99f5-38071bf00457","name":"Select anywhere t