659","backgroundColor":"#FFF","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>Identical view to the previous page with no visible change: the completed RFP with the filled &quot;50,000 units per month&quot; and &quot;20 weeks&quot; values, and Claude&apos;s summary of the evaluation weights, resolved comments, and the two notes about the remaining Section 5 placeholder and direct (non-tracked) edits. Page 1 of 4.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">When we jump to the result, we see that Claude gets several things right because it can reach Microsoft 365 content through the connector.  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">But because access is fragmented, it is not the same as understanding the full work context.  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Scroll down to section 2 </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Scope of Work</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">For example, it missed the chat from my manager asking for a minimum engineering batch of 5,000 units, which should be in the Scope of Work.  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Scroll to the bottom.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">It also missed the custom terms and conditions from a separate document.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">In terms of trust, Copilot automatically upgraded the sensitivity label. Claude did not-even though it used information from a highly confidential source.  </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">All of this matters when AI is creating real enterprise work products. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Microsoft’s advantage is the integrated AI platform.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">This feature shows up as faster execution, better accuracy, stronger trust, and better economics. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Copilot includes this value in the $30 monthly SKU, while Claude requires a $20 monthly enterprise license plus consumption costs for every task. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select the </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Appendix A -- CMO Qualification Questionnaire.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"acc3a764-59cc-4012-8bd7-729bdf83ce97-0.webp","imageId":"acc3a764-59cc-4012-8bd7-729bdf83ce97-0","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"auto","horizontalScrollOffset":0.0,"verticalScrollOffset":0.0,"childrenRelative":true,"lastChildFill":false,"children":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"a72befe2-60aa-41e2-bcc7-6c079ea9e083.png","imageId":"a72befe2-60aa-41e2-bcc7-6c079ea9e083","height":1871,"width":871},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","c