rk &quot;Customize&quot; screen with Plugins / Skills tabs (Plugins selected) and an &quot;Upload plugin&quot; button. An &quot;Installed&quot; section lists plugins with on/off toggles: Fabric IQ (on), Dynamics 365 Sales (off), and Dynamics 365 ERP apps (on, with a settings gear). Below, a &quot;Discover&quot; section shows a searchable grid of available plugins: AI Meeting Notes TeamsMaestro (free AI note taker for Teams, powered by ChatGPT &amp; Claude), Box, Canva, Dotted (automate status reports/stakeholder updates), enosix arnold for Copilot Cowork (SAP ERP order intelligence), and Flow Studio MCP Copilot Cowork (connect Cowork to Power Automate).</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">...but also our ERP, Dynamics 365, and data from Fabric IQ, which we’ll do with the plug-ins we see here.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">And plug-ins aren’t just for Microsoft products; there are many 3rd party plug-ins as well.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Skills</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"1061c6fe-cf9b-4a39-a347-7475e4015b19.webp","imageId":"1061c6fe-cf9b-4a39-a347-7475e4015b19","height":33,"width":58},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"hidden