","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>The Cowork Customize screen switched to the &quot;Skills&quot; tab (with an &quot;Add&quot; button). &quot;Skills teach Cowork how to perform a specific task.&quot; A &quot;Your skills&quot; section lists custom skills: contract-renewal-radar (scans Dynamics 365 purchase and price agreements for upcoming expirations/auto-renewals), rfp-grading (orchestrates end-to-end evaluation of supplier RFP responses in a pharmaceutical sourcing context), and spend-analysis (aggregates procurement spend from Dynamics 365 purchase-order data, blended with Microsoft Fabric supplier data). A &quot;Built-in&quot; section below lists skills that ship with Cowork and can&apos;t be disabled: PDF, Word, and Excel (read, create and manipulate those document types).</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">We also have skills that help Cowork run our processes more efficiently and with higher quality. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">rfp-grading</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"e4574cb7-e242-40c1-8e9f-1e669f66ae5c.webp","imageId":"e4574cb7-e242-40c1-8e9f-1e669f66ae5c","height":65,"width":679},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"h