nd scoring criteria from Dynamics 365, cross-checks vendor claims against Microsoft Fabric performance history (via the Fabric IQ plugin), layers in Work IQ relationship signals, scores all vendors on a weighted basis, writes scores back to D365, and produces a PowerPoint plus an HTML scorecard. It lists trigger phrases (&quot;run the supplier bid evaluation,&quot; &quot;score the supplier bids,&quot; etc.) and warns against using it to draft the RFP itself or for generic outreach. An &quot;Instructions&quot; panel below shows the skill&apos;s own documentation: an Overview describing the &quot;Supplier Bid Evaluator&quot; harness fusing four data layers (bid submissions, D365 scoring criteria, Fabric performance history, Work IQ relationship health) into a weighted scorecard, a &quot;When to Use&quot; list, and a &quot;When NOT to Use&quot; list.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">For this task, Cowork is going to use our custom RFP grading skill to understand exactly what to do.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Back</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"c2f2a192-8516-4161-b4a8-ab4ac2103ec0.webp","imageId":"c2f2a192-8516-4161-b4a8-ab4ac2103ec0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"1fe3cc5a-9b66-4481-bf8b-727d651b968f-0.webp","imageId":"1fe3cc5a-9b66-4481-bf8b-727d651b968f-0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"48ef949b-9404-45c3-a187-2262cd13a406-0.webp","imageId":"48ef949b-9404-45c3-a187-2262cd13a406-0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"4cdd6520-415b-4593-af98-fc57c303672e-0.webp","imageId":"4cdd6520-415b-4593-af98-fc57c303672e-0","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit"