e earlier &quot;What I completed&quot; summary and the two output file cards, a new user message &quot;/cost&quot; appears (marked &quot;Just now&quot;) and Cowork replies with the credits usage: &quot;2,621.5 credits used for this task so far.&quot; The Workspace panel (9 steps complete, two outputs, rfp-grading and PowerPoint) is unchanged.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">About 2,600 credits, which translates to $26.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">That ability to take previously outsourced processes in-house without adding headcount is amazing. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">But a tool as powerful-and potentially expensive-as this needs controls and oversight so the business can manage consumptive spend. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Next we’ll see how we do that. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select anywhere on the screen to advance.</span></p><p></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"a112ea14-2721-4e32-a482-36553f3e73a1-0.webp","imageId":"a112ea14-2721-4e32-a482-36553f3e73a1-0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"417e63a1-bfe2-4b9e-856a-d7d022195e1c-0.webp","imageId":"417e63a1-bfe2-4b9e-856a-d7d022195e1c-0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"ec4e7db9-76cb-4e42-830c-4efd195732ee-0.webp","imageId":"ec4e7db9-76cb-4e42-830c-4efd195732ee-0","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"b7e26b32-d6a3-4692-9bd8-c2d3370c39de-0.webp","imageId":"b7e26b32-d6a3-4692-9bd8-c2d3370c39de-0","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"1bb120c3-c717-464b-b1d1-0bd6ed102e57","name":"Select anywhere to advance","clickAction":"Default","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":true,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"setVariableTo":"true","x":-2.0,"y":0.0,"width":1922.3837