 UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Cost management</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":0.0,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"823070a0-e400-4dfc-8724-6ad4f5611ede.webp","imageId":"823070a0-e400-4dfc-8724-6ad4f5611ede","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"dddc3b6c-971c-42f8-a799-0d37449596a8.webp","imageId":"dddc3b6c-971c-42f8-a799-0d37449596a8","height":42,"width":254},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"hidden","horizontalScrollOffset":0.0,"verticalScrollOffset":0.0,"childrenRelative":false,"lastChildFill":false,"shapeId":"569a76ca-54cc-4530-8d96-6420fb18d904","name":"Hover Image 1","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":false,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":0.0,"y":315.0,"width":254.0,"height":42.0,"isAspectLocked":true,"locked":false,"padding":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]},{"type":"Beacon","style":"Rectangle","color":"#FFB900","cornerRadius":{"topLeft":8.0,"topRight":8.0,"bottomRight":8.0,"bottomLeft":8.0},"maxSize":0,"shapeId":"adbb558b-23f7-4f02-a891-a69bc39620c8-beacon","name":"Cost management","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":0.0,"y":315.0,"width":254.0,"height":42.0,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false},{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"adbb558b-23f7-4f02-a891-a69bc39620c8","name":"Cost management","clickAction":"Next","hoverAction":"ToggleShape","hoverActionData":"569a76ca-54cc-4530-8d96-6420fb18d904","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":0.0,"y":315.0,"width":254.0,"height":42.0,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]}],"transitionMode":"Manual","transitionType":"None","transitionSlideDirection":"Top","transitionLength":0.0,"transitionAfter":0.0,"transitionOnScroll":false,"defaultAction":"Next","originalIndex":1,"localizationInfo":[]},{"screenId":"27d73d42-fa58-46ab-beb4-a692e6902d0e","backgroundColor":"#0000","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>The Copilot &quot;Cost management&quot; page (Overview tab; Configuration and Consumption tabs also present) for monitoring AI credit usage, billing and spending limits. Four KPI cards at the top show month-to-date figures: Total Copilot Credits used 5,071,996; Prepaid capacity pack credits used 5,071,996 of 7,500,000; Pay-as-you-go credits used 0; Active users of Copilot Credits 11,250. A &quot;Monitor&quot; section has panels for &quot;Groups spending the least credits&quot; (Executives 63,472, Procurement 121,398, Legal 157,246, Human Resources 219,473) and &quot;Groups spending the most credits&quot; (Sales 887,542, Customer Support 746,918, Engineering 673,205, Marketing 541,687), each with a &quot;Manage group spending&quot; button. Below are a &quot;Spending trend (month to date)&quot; bar chart of daily credit consumption (Prepaid 5,071,996, Pay-as-you-go 0), an &quot;Agents and services spending the most credits&quot; panel (Copilot Cowork 4,319,614; Microsoft Scout 752,382), and a &quot;Users spending the most credits&quot; panel (Anne Krupke 19,247; Efe Abugo 18,916; Angie Springer 18,573; Cora Thomas 18,241; Miti Joshi 17,988).</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">The Cost Management Overview shows me how our entire company is using Copilot credits, and which groups and users are the most active. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">I can monitor total Copilot credits used, number of active users, and the spending trends throughout the month. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Configuration</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"28425a6d-121e-4f0c-864a-1437cfe5cdb5.webp","imageId":"28425a6d-121e-4f0c-864a-1437cfe5cdb5","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"7bc26970-116a-4c83-aedd-d68b91c56456.webp","imageId":"7bc26970-116a-4c83-aedd-d68b91c56456","height":44,"width":101},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"hidden","horizontalScrollOffset":0.0,"verticalScrollOffset":0.0,"childrenRelative":false,"lastChildFill":false,"shapeId":"ccc1cc7c-beee-45d8-8842-8f565f2213bb","name":"Hover Image 1","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":false,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":392.0,"y":127.0,"width":101.0,"height":44.0,"isAspectLocked":true,"locked":false,"padd