t;Send alert emails when the credit threshold is reached,&quot; a &quot;Trigger alert when credits Reach&quot; dropdown, an &quot;Alert threshold&quot; of 5% (× 1,500 credits), and recipient chips Miti Joshi and Efe Abugo with an &quot;Add recipient&quot; button. A final section, &quot;Select monthly budget limits for users (optional),&quot; has a toggle (off) to cap per-user monthly spend. Save changes and Cancel buttons are at the bottom.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">I can set monthly limits and alerts to notify me when they reach certain thresholds.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Close </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">in the upper right.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"4abc252f-a570-493a-b1b2-1eee75787ce2.webp","imageId":"4abc252f-a570-493a-b1b2-1eee75787ce2","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"2bf6b544-182f-49e3-b396-a6194f1d0abb.webp","imageId":"2bf6b544-182f-49e3-b396-a6194f1d0abb","height":34,"width":34},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"hidden","horizontalScrollOffset":0.0,"verticalScrollOffset":0.0,"childrenRelative":false,"lastChildFill":false,"shapeId":"f0f770d8-9563-4133-9f0e-36dbd1cf07c3","name":"Hover Image 1","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":