Capacity Packs) and the Add spending policy / Buy prepaid credits / Refresh buttons.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Consumption</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"644c2f14-b151-4baa-94eb-88f5b4d75685.webp","imageId":"644c2f14-b151-4baa-94eb-88f5b4d75685","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"b306386c-6837-4f85-8080-2ed8cef365d2.webp","imageId":"b306386c-6837-4f85-8080-2ed8cef365d2","height":44,"width":98},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0.0,"bottomLeft":0.0},"foregroundColor":"black","fontSize":16.0,"text":"","textAlignment":"Left","canScroll":false,"headingLevel":"None","horizontalScroll":"hidden","verticalScroll":"hidden","horizontalScrollOffset":0.0,"verticalScrollOffset":0.0,"childrenRelative":false,"lastChildFill":false,"shapeId":"e78436c3-dbca-4302-b713-b146108c29c5","name":"Hover Image 1","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":false,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":496.0,"y":174.0,"width":98.0,"height":44.0,"isAspectLocked":true,"locked":false,"padding":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]},{"type":"Beacon","style":"Rectangle","color":"#FFB900","cornerRadius":{"topLeft":8.0,"topRight":8.0,"bottomRight":8.0,"bottomLeft":8.0},"maxSize":0,"shapeId":"a6934067-055d-4006-af49-a470518c2c39-beacon","name":"Consumption","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":496.0,"y":174.0,"width":98.0,"height":44.0,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false},{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"a6934067-055d-4006-af49-a470518c2c39","name":"Consumption","clickAction":"Next","hoverAction":"ToggleShape","hoverActionData":"e78436c3-dbca-4302-b713-b146108c29c5","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":496.0,"y":174.0,"width":98.0,"height":44.0,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]}],"transitionMode":"Manual","transitionType":"None","transitionSlideDirection":"Top","transitionLength":0.0,"transitionAfter":0.0,"transitionOnScroll":false,"defaultAction":"Next","originalIndex":6,"localizationInfo":[]},{"screenId":"35dd32d1-6692-4e06-8930-0afe678e23a1","backgroundColor":"#FFF","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>The Cost management &quot;Consumption&quot; tab, headed &quot;Copilot credit usage,&quot; with three summary tiles: Users 11,250 (selected), Groups 12, Agents and services 2. A per-user table (Microsoft 365 Copilot License / Copilot credits requested sub-tabs) shows 10 of 11,250 users with columns Monthly limit, Total credits used, Microsoft 365 Copilot License, and Last activity date: Anne Krupke (30,000 / 24,349 / Yes / 7/14/2026), Efe Abugo (15,000 / 7,642 / 7/13/2026), Angie Springer (20,000 / 6,415 / 7/14/2026), Cora Thomas (No limit / 5,127 / 7/12/2026), Miti Joshi (No limit / 3,896 / 7/9/2026), Lisa Taylor (20,000 / 4,338 / 7/8/2026), Adele Vance (20,000 / 8,573 / 7/13/2026), Corey Gray (20,000 / 7,397 / 7/11/2026), Mario Rogers (20,000 / 3,528 / 7/8/2026), and Wanda Howard (No limit / 2,385 / 7/6/2026). Toolbar options include Month to date, Export and Manage Columns.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">And finally, on the Consumption page I can see a detailed breakdown of the users, groups, and agents that are consuming Copilot credits, so when we see a trend in spend, we can quickly understand what’s driving it. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">The Microsoft Admin Center gives me full control over exactly who gets credits and how they’re using them. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">This is where we can understand adoption, manage spend, and make smarter decisions about where these capabilities are delivering the most value. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">That makes it clear how we get the value out of Cowork without losing control over cost.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">There’s another new category of agent on the scene, Autopilots, that can carry out complex work autonomously.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Now I’ll switch back to the business user perspective and show how Microsoft Scout works alongside Copilot and Cowork.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select anywhere on the screen to advance.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[],"shapes":[{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"5b280451-1ec0-408c-b8fb-122aa1e52234","name":"Select anywhere to advance","clickAction":"Default","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":true,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"setVariableTo":"true","x":-2.0,"y":0.0,"width":1922.38376127689,"height":1080.53435114504,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]}],"transitionMode":"Manual","transitionType":"None","transitionSlideDirection":"Top","transitionLength":0.0,"transitionAfter":0.0,"transitionOnScroll":false,"defaultAction":"Next","originalIndex":7,"videoPath":"35dd32d1-6692-4e06-8930-0afe678e23a1.mp4","videoFrameCount":17,"videoPosterPath":"35dd32d1-6692-4e06-8930-0afe678e23a1_poster.webp","localizationInfo":[]}],"localizationInfo":[]},{"sectionId":"7df53d1f-bc80-462a-92f1-a19cd9d1b422","title":"4.1 Scout","thumbnailPath":"section-11.webp","screens":[{"screenId":"67331a52-05b7-4bf3-b058-3f339f232a79","backgroundColor":"#0000","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>A Microsoft Teams-style chat with an AI agent named &quot;Otto&quot; (Scout), pinned at the top of the chats list with recent contacts below (Priya Shah, Allerveo Kickoff Sync, Marcus Lin, Dana Reyes, Devon Park, Maya Okafor, and others). The Otto conversation has tabs Chat / Shared / Activity / Skills / Habits / Organization. The visible thread shows Otto drafting an email under Anne Krupke&apos;s name (a corrective-plan meeting request referencing Q3 OTIF trend, open CAPA items and a proposed corrective plan), the user replying &quot;Ship it,&quot; and Otto confirming it sent to Sana and is circling the Allerveo redlines to Jordan to protect the tech-transfer timeline. The user then asks Otto to &quot;get me ready for the Allerveo kickoff tomorrow,&quot; and Otto agrees to pull the overnight thread activity and prep the CMO onboarding package. A &quot;Today&quot; divider follows, with Otto posting at 7:26 AM an early flag that yesterday&apos;s Allerveo thread shifted (owners, dependencies and escalation timing all moved) and that Mia Chen declined Thursday&apos;s stakeholder review, which it&apos;s folding into the morning brief.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">I’m switching back into the business user role to show how Scout helps me stay ahead of execution. I showed you how we scored the RFP, but that’s just one of the many things on my plate. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Often there are too many tasks for me to keep track of on my own. That’s where Microsoft Scout comes in- Scout runs on autopilot 24x7 and uses Work IQ to execute on my behalf. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select anywhere to advance.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":0.0,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"6c061926-2d25-4d8b-9fc7-38fcee1cb4f0.webp","imageId":"6c061926-2d25-4d8b-9fc7-38fcee1cb4f0","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"6ef48223-3b35-455d-8c94-51fcbc5a5a19","name":"Select anywhere to advance","clickAction":"Default","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":true,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"setVariableTo":"true","x":-3.0,"y":0.0,"width":1923.39916839917,"height":1081.35135135135,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]}],"transitionMode":"Manual","transitionType":"None","transitionSlideDirection":"Top","transitionLength":0.0,"transitionAfter":0.0,"transitionOnScroll":false,"defaultAction":"Next","originalIndex":1,"localizationInfo":[]},{"screenId":"f3a12d09-cdf9-4dab-a61f-cab2b1fdcbb2","backgroundColor":"#FFF","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">I’m in my Teams chat with Scout, where it’s updating me on everything it’s been doing.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">[</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-style:italic;\">This page will automatically transition when animation is complete</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">]</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"5c912853-0999-48af-92f0-ec66935b83a2.webp","imageId":"5c912853-0999-48af-92f0-ec66935b83a2","height":1080,"width":1920},{"path":"462418ce-b25f-4063-a06c-44529f78804e-0.webp","imageId":"462418ce-b25f-4063-a06c-44529f78804e-0","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Video","isVideo":true,"path":"2-Scoutmessage1-5S-compressed.mp4","autoPlay":true,"showControls":false,"mute":false,"loop":false,"isAnnotation":false,"shapeId":"2aeedb62-f55c-4062-8a85-e8cd52e4417f","name":"Video","clickAction":"None","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":false,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"x":0.0,"y":0.0,"width":1920.0,"height":1080.0,"isAspectLocked":false,"locked":false,"padding":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"itemRole":"none","isSelected":false,"isExpanded":false,"localizationInfo":[]}],"transitionMode":"Automatic","transitionType":"None","transitionSlideDirection":"Top","transitionLength":0.0,"transitionAfter":5.0,"transitionOnScroll":false,"defaultAction":"Next","originalIndex":2,"localizationInfo":[]},{"screenId":"97648502-b21c-4c0c-8795-384fce9a8788","backgroundColor":"#FFF","width":1920,"height":1080,"description":"<div><p><span>Identical view to the previous page with no visible change: Otto&apos;s morning briefing and the &quot;Three moves before the Allerveo kickoff&quot; suggestions card (approval for the draft technology transfer package, the updated Project Execution Plan, and the Friday-rescheduled stakeholder review) with the &quot;Go through all three&quot; button.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">It knows this supplier contract is top priority, so that’s what it’s focusing on.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Hover over the </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Approval needed for draft technology transfer package </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">card.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">First, Scout flags an upcoming supplier onboarding milestone and offers to pull together the materials and draft the supplier response.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Hover over </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">the Updated the Allerveo Project Execution Plan </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">card.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Second, it saw an internal planning document is out of date and offers to update it.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Hover over the </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Stakeholder review rescheduled for Friday </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">card.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Third, it noticed a critical stakeholder declined a review, so it will reschedule for me.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Let’s run the first item it flagged. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select the </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Approval needed for draft technology transfer package </span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">card.</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></div>","animationDelay":0.0,"animationType":"Normal","images":[{"path":"c97bffdc-1bf8-4297-9ec1-86a171f46752.webp","imageId":"c97bffdc-1bf8-4297-9ec1-86a171f46752","height":1080,"width":1920}],"shapes":[{"type":"Styled","image":{"path":"c29fc1c1-081c-43cf-b583-6e2bcd888e0b.webp","imageId":"c29fc1c1-081c-43cf-b583-6e2bcd888e0b","height":382,"width":289},"imageVerticalAlign":"Center","imageHorizontalAlign":"Center","imageFit":"fill","isScreenReaderVisible":true,"isAnnotation":false,"isPresenterViewVisible":false,"backgroundColor":"#0000","border":{"left":0.0,"top":0.0,"right":0.0,"bottom":0.0},"borderColor":"#0000","borderRadius":{"topLeft":0.0,"topRight":0.0,"bottomRight":0