ggestion — the updated PEP), with a Copilot pane on the right. A Summary banner notes the plan covers onboarding Annterra Pharma as a contract manufacturer for Allerveo 180 mg Tablets, target 50,000 units monthly by September 8, 2026. The document is a Caldova Pharmaceuticals &quot;Project Execution Plan — Contract Manufacturing Onboarding &amp; Technology Transfer — Allerveo 180 mg Tablet Supply&quot; (Supplier: Annterra Pharma, Vendor CM-001; Program RFQ 000010). A document-control table lists Document ID PEP-ALLERVEO-CM001-v1.0, owner Anne Krupke, Version 1.0, Status Approved for Execution, Effective Date 1 June 2026, Classification Confidential, Monthly review cycle. A &quot;Program at a Glance&quot; table restates the key facts (Allerveo Demand Surge / CMO Capacity, RX-ALLERVEO-180 oral solid dose, Annterra CM-001 New Jersey USA, 50,000 units/month, $4.85/unit preferred rate, 14-week lead time, first commercial delivery target Sept 8 2026 week 14, 3-year contract, FDA NAI quality status, owner Anne Krupke, primary contact Thomas Reyes). A &quot;1. Purpose &amp; Scope&quot; section follows. The Copilot pane shows &quot;Let&apos;s edit your document&quot; with the usual suggestions. Page 1 of 4.</span></p></div>","presenterNotes":"<div><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Once again Copilot is right there, so I could make edits directly before sending out.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">Let’s go back to Teams.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;font-weight:bold;\">Action</span><span style=\"font-family:Segoe UI;\">: Select anywhere to advance.</span></p></div>","animationDelay":41.66666666666667,"animationType":"Normal","images":[],"shapes":[{"type":"Shape","shapeId":"2ac8c437-f7b7-4eb0-b321-653b1b9502f1","name":"Select anywhere to advance","clickAction":"Default","hoverAction":"None","hoverPersists":true,"hoverDelay":0.0,"isVisible":true,"animationMode":"LastImage","visibleOnIndexes":[],"setVariableTo":"true","x":-3.0,"y":0.0